OL,3,GNEWSAFlood warning as heavy rain and
OL,4,Athunderstorms predicted
OL,5,
OL,6,FHeavy rain and thunderstorms could
OL,7,Fcause disruption across Wales on
OL,8,FSunday, according to the Met Office.
OL,10,FAlthough some areas will miss the
OL,11,Fheaviest downpours, up to 4cm (1.5in)
OL,12,Fof rain could fall elsewhere.
OL,14,FThe forecaster said it could also lead
OL,15,Fto flooding and travel disruption, with
OL,16,Fa yellow weather warning in place
OL,17,Facross the whole of Wales from 11:00
OL,18,FBST until 23:59.
OL,20,FHowever, the worst conditions are
OL,21,Fexpected to become more isolated later
OL,22,Fin the evening, it added.
OL,23,APub: 30-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
